{"seq":2,"slug":"dispute-case-cross-team-flow","title":"争议工单与客服/风控协同","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/payment-chargeback-dispute-representment/chargeback-ops-monitoring/dispute-case-cross-team-flow","wordCount":1635,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"争议工单与客服-风控协同\">争议工单与客服/风控协同</h1><p>争议处理的成败，很多时候不在于证据有多强，而在于<strong>信息有没有在时限内流转到正确的人手里</strong>。一笔拒付从进入到终局，通常要经过客服（客户沟通、取消记录）、履约（物流、签收）、支付（认证、授权记录）、风控（欺诈判定）和争议运营（应诉决策）五个角色的手。任何一处断链，结果都是错过 7 到 21 天的应诉窗口——而错过窗口是不可恢复的。这一章讲如何把这条链路建成一个有 SLA、有事件、有归属的工单系统。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-工单的角色与信息流\">核心概念：工单的角色与信息流</h2><p>先明确每个角色在争议中提供什么、消费什么。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  D[争议创建事件] --&gt; O[争议运营: 建单/定级]&#10;  O --&gt; CS[客服: 客户沟通与取消记录]&#10;  O --&gt; F[履约: 物流签收与地址]&#10;  O --&gt; P[支付: 认证/授权/AVS/CVC]&#10;  O --&gt; R[风控: 欺诈判定与历史行为]&#10;  CS --&gt; E[证据池]&#10;  F --&gt; E&#10;  P --&gt; E&#10;  R --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; O&#10;  O --&gt;|提交| N[卡组织]&#10;  O --&gt;|决策| A[接受或应诉]&#10;  O --&gt;|根因| I[改进: 产品/流程/披露]\">graph TD\n  D[争议创建事件] --&gt; O[争议运营: 建单/定级]\n  O --&gt; CS[客服: 客户沟通与取消记录]\n  O --&gt; F[履约: 物流签收与地址]\n  O --&gt; P[支付: 认证/授权/AVS/CVC]\n  O --&gt; R[风控: 欺诈判定与历史行为]\n  CS --&gt; E[证据池]\n  F --&gt; E\n  P --&gt; E\n  R --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; O\n  O --&gt;|提交| N[卡组织]\n  O --&gt;|决策| A[接受或应诉]\n  O --&gt;|根因| I[改进: 产品/流程/披露]</pre><p>图中的关键设计是<strong>证据池</strong>：四个角色并行供给证据，争议运营统一组装提交。若让争议运营自己去四个系统里找，不但慢，而且容易遗漏——特别是物流与认证记录这两个最容易在时限内拿不到的部分。</p>\n<h3 id=\"谁在什么时限内响应\">谁在什么时限内响应</h3><p>把角色的响应义务写成 SLA 是防止断链的唯一办法。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>提供内容</th>\n<th>建议 SLA</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>争议运营</td>\n<td>建单、定级、组装、提交</td>\n<td>建单 ≤ 1h</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>客服</td>\n<td>沟通记录、取消记录、政策披露证据</td>\n<td>≤ 24h</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>履约</td>\n<td>承运商、跟踪号、签收截图、配送地址</td>\n<td>≤ 24h</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支付</td>\n<td>3DS 结果/ECI、AVS/CVC 结果、购买 IP</td>\n<td>自动，≤ 5min</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风控</td>\n<td>历史交易匹配、CE3.0 候选、欺诈评分</td>\n<td>自动，≤ 5min</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>支付与风控两行应尽量自动化——它们的输出是结构化字段，适合在争议创建时同步拉取。客服与履约涉及人工，必须给足缓冲并设置升级路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工单状态机与事件设计\">工单状态机与事件设计</h2><p>工单的状态必须比争议本身的状态更细，因为它要承载&quot;内部处理进度&quot;这一维度。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TYPE ticket_state AS ENUM (&#10;  &#39;open&#39;,              -- 建单，等待分派&#10;  &#39;collecting&#39;,        -- 并行取证中&#10;  &#39;review&#39;,            -- 人工复核证据完整性&#10;  &#39;ready&#39;,             -- 证据齐备，待提交&#10;  &#39;submitted&#39;,         -- 已提交，等待裁决&#10;  &#39;closed_won&#39;,&#10;  &#39;closed_lost&#39;,&#10;  &#39;closed_accepted&#39;,   -- 主动接受&#10;  &#39;closed_abandoned&#39;   -- 超时未处理(应告警)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE dispute_ticket (&#10;  ticket_id     BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  dispute_id    BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES dispute(dispute_id),&#10;  state         ticket_state NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;open&#39;,&#10;  owner_role    TEXT,                     -- cs | fulfillment | payment | risk | ops&#10;  sla_due_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,     -- 由争议 due_by 反推&#10;  created_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  updated_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE ticket_event (&#10;  id          BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  ticket_id   BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES dispute_ticket(ticket_id),&#10;  from_state  ticket_state,&#10;  to_state    ticket_state NOT NULL,&#10;  actor       TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  payload     JSONB,&#10;  at          TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TYPE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ticket_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ENUM (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'open'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,              </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 建单，等待分派</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'collecting'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 并行取证中</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'review'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 人工复核证据完整性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'ready'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,             </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 证据齐备，待提交</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'submitted'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,         </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 已提交，等待裁决</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'closed_won'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'closed_lost'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'closed_accepted'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 主动接受</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'closed_abandoned'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   -- 超时未处理(应告警)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> dispute_ticket</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ticket_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dispute_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dispute(dispute_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         ticket_state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'open'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  owner_role    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- cs | fulfillment | payment | risk | ops</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sla_due_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 由争议 due_by 反推</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  updated_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ticket_event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ticket_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dispute_ticket(ticket_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  from_state  ticket_state,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  to_state    ticket_state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  actor       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  payload     JSONB,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>closed_abandoned</code> 是必须显式建模的状态。它的存在让&quot;超时未处理&quot;成为一个<strong>可告警、可统计</strong>的事件，而不是一个静默的记忆缺失。实践中，把&quot;接近超时&quot;也做成事件，能在窗口末端自动升级到值班人员。</p>\n<h3 id=\"超时升级\">超时升级</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def escalate_if_needed(ticket, now):&#10;    remaining = (ticket.sla_due_at - now).total_seconds()&#10;    if remaining &lt; 0:&#10;        return &quot;abandoned&quot;          # 触发 P0 告警&#10;    if remaining &lt; 86400 and ticket.state in (&quot;collecting&quot;, &quot;review&quot;):&#10;        return &quot;escalate&quot;           # 24h 内到期且未就绪 → 升级&#10;    if remaining &lt; 3 * 86400 and ticket.state == &quot;collecting&quot;:&#10;        return &quot;nudge_owner&quot;        # 提醒各角色补齐证据&#10;    return &quot;ok&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> escalate_if_needed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ticket, now):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    remaining </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (ticket.sla_due_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> now).total_seconds()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> remaining </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"abandoned\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          # 触发 P0 告警</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> remaining </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 86400</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ticket.state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"collecting\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"review\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"escalate\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">           # 24h 内到期且未就绪 → 升级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> remaining </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 86400</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ticket.state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"collecting\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"nudge_owner\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 提醒各角色补齐证据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"ok\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>升级阈值要按网络窗口动态调整：窗口为 7 天的网络，24 小时的&quot;临近&quot;阈值就不适用，应按窗口比例计算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"客服与争议运营的协同\">客服与争议运营的协同</h2><p>客服是唯一在拒付发生<strong>之前</strong>就接触到客户的角色，因此它同时是预防与举证两个环节的关键。</p>\n<h3 id=\"事前-把拒付拦在客服\">事前：把拒付拦在客服</h3><p>Stripe 的观察很直接：与客户频繁、清晰的沟通能避免相当一部分拒付，快速响应、处理退款或换货能显著减少客户发起拒付的机会（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/disputes/prevention/best-practices\">Stripe: Fraud prevention best practices</a>）。工程上这意味着<strong>客服工单系统需要有一条回写到风控的通道</strong>：客户在争议前提出退款诉求并被拒，是一个高价值的拒付预测信号。这条信号的使用方式见 <a href=\"../friendly-fraud-prevention/friendly-fraud-pattern-detect\">友好欺诈与滥用模式识别</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"事后-客服沟通记录是证据\">事后：客服沟通记录是证据</h3><p>争议发生后，客服与客户的往来记录本身就是证据。Stripe 说明，争议详情页有时会展示发卡行附上的客户主张文件，你可以据此了解具体投诉并针对性回应；且争议过程中与客户的<strong>所有沟通记录都应留存，因为它们是随答复提交的证据</strong>（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/disputes/responding\">Stripe: Responding to disputes</a>）。</p>\n<p>有一处容易被误解的边界：Stripe 提醒，商户常附上邮件或短信往来，但这些往来<strong>并未经过身份验证</strong>（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/disputes/best-practices\">Stripe: Dispute evidence best practices</a>）。因此沟通记录只能作为佐证，不能单独充当本人身份的证据——这条与 <a href=\"../friendly-fraud-prevention/3ds-avs-proof-delivery-control\">3DS/AVS/CVC/签收前置防控（联036）</a> 中关于认证证据的讨论相互印证。</p>\n<h3 id=\"一个实操问题-客服该不该直接退款\">一个实操问题：客服该不该直接退款</h3><p>当客服判断该退，正确做法是<strong>退款</strong>而不是让客户撤回争议。原因在于卡组织的计数规则：网络只看&quot;收到的争议件数&quot;，不看反诉成功或失败，<strong>被撤回的争议仍算一件</strong>（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/disputes/best-practices\">Stripe: Dispute evidence best practices</a>）。因此让客户撤回对拒付率毫无帮助，且在时间上更慢。</p>\n<h2 id=\"风控与争议运营的协同\">风控与争议运营的协同</h2><p>风控在争议流程里扮演两个角色：其一是<strong>举证供给方</strong>（历史交易匹配、设备指纹、欺诈评分），其二是<strong>反馈接收方</strong>（从拒付结果学习，改进前置拦截规则）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"反馈闭环\">反馈闭环</h3><p>争议结果是最有价值的欺诈标签。把它回灌到风控模型，是唯一能让拦截率随时间提升的机制。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 按 (支付指纹, 理由码) 回灌拒付结果，供风控规则使用&#10;WITH outcome AS (&#10;  SELECT d.reason_code,&#10;         p.payment_fingerprint,&#10;         count(*) FILTER (WHERE d.stage = &#39;lost&#39;) AS lost_count,&#10;         count(*) AS total&#10;  FROM dispute d&#10;  JOIN payment p ON p.charge_id = d.charge_id&#10;  WHERE d.created_at &gt; now() - interval &#39;12 months&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY 1, 2&#10;)&#10;SELECT payment_fingerprint,&#10;       sum(total)      AS disputes,&#10;       sum(lost_count) AS losses,&#10;       round(sum(lost_count)::numeric / nullif(sum(total), 0), 3) AS loss_ratio&#10;FROM outcome&#10;GROUP BY payment_fingerprint&#10;HAVING sum(total) &gt;= 2&#10;ORDER BY loss_ratio DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 按 (支付指纹, 理由码) 回灌拒付结果，供风控规则使用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> outcome </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">reason_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">payment_fingerprint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">stage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'lost'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lost_count,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dispute d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> payment p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">charge_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">charge_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">created_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'12 months'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> payment_fingerprint,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(total)      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> disputes,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(lost_count) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> losses,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(lost_count)::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nullif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(total), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> loss_ratio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> outcome</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> payment_fingerprint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(total) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> loss_ratio </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这张视图同时服务两个目的：为下次同类争议提供 CE3.0 的历史交易候选，以及为主体的友好欺诈评分供数。<strong>共用一份视图</strong>是设计上的刻意选择——两处若各自建一份，口径迟早会漂移。</p>\n<h3 id=\"责任边界\">责任边界</h3><p>协同中最容易产生摩擦的是&quot;这笔拒付是谁的责任&quot;。建议按可归因性划分：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>拒付类型</th>\n<th>首要归因</th>\n<th>次要归因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>真欺诈（被盗卡）</td>\n<td>风控拦截规则</td>\n<td>支付前置（3DS 覆盖）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>友好欺诈</td>\n<td>产品/披露</td>\n<td>客服</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未收货</td>\n<td>履约</td>\n<td>客服</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>描述不符</td>\n<td>商品页描述</td>\n<td>产品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>续费争议</td>\n<td>订阅披露与通知</td>\n<td>客服</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>归因的目的不是追责，而是决定<strong>根因改进投给谁</strong>。这张表应定期按实际拒付分布回算，避免归因长期偏离事实。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>争议工单需承载五个角色的并行取证，核心设计是&quot;证据池&quot;：各角色供给，运营统一组装。</li>\n<li>工单状态须比争议状态更细，并显式建模 <code>closed_abandoned</code> 让超时成为可告警事件。</li>\n<li>升级阈值应按网络窗口比例计算，7 天窗口不能沿用 24 小时的临近阈值。</li>\n<li>客服工单中的&quot;退款诉求被拒&quot;是高价值拒付预测信号，应回写风控。</li>\n<li>沟通记录可作证据但<strong>未经身份验证</strong>，不能单独充当本人证据。</li>\n<li>该退款就退款、不要让客户撤回争议——撤回的争议同样计数。</li>\n<li>拒付结果应回灌风控，且 CE3.0 检索视图与友好欺诈评分视图应共用一份以免口径漂移。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"争议工单与客服/风控协同","id":"争议工单与客服-风控协同"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：工单的角色与信息流","id":"核心概念-工单的角色与信息流"},{"level":3,"text":"谁在什么时限内响应","id":"谁在什么时限内响应"},{"level":2,"text":"工单状态机与事件设计","id":"工单状态机与事件设计"},{"level":3,"text":"超时升级","id":"超时升级"},{"level":2,"text":"客服与争议运营的协同","id":"客服与争议运营的协同"},{"level":3,"text":"事前：把拒付拦在客服","id":"事前-把拒付拦在客服"},{"level":3,"text":"事后：客服沟通记录是证据","id":"事后-客服沟通记录是证据"},{"level":3,"text":"一个实操问题：客服该不该直接退款","id":"一个实操问题-客服该不该直接退款"},{"level":2,"text":"风控与争议运营的协同","id":"风控与争议运营的协同"},{"level":3,"text":"反馈闭环","id":"反馈闭环"},{"level":3,"text":"责任边界","id":"责任边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"VDMP/ECP 拒付率监控与罚款阈值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/payment-chargeback-dispute-representment/chargeback-ops-monitoring/vdmp-ecp-rate-monitor-fine"},"next":{"title":"拒付成本/Win-rate 与收单机构管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/payment-chargeback-dispute-representment/chargeback-ops-monitoring/chargeback-cost-acquirer-mgmt"}}